 "_comment": [
  "R2654 Library short-name translations, consumed by tools/patch_r2654_library.py",
  "(variable-length sub rebuilder; runs in build_v9 Step 6.5 AFTER inject_r34_db.py",
  "and patch_r2654_names.py).  Top-level numeric keys = R2654 sub index; inner keys",
  "= Format-A entry index (0-based, entry 0 is usually the blank placeholder).",
  "Groups NOT listed here ship byte-identical from the build input (composes with",
  "Step 2 fixed-size body edits owned by chunk_r2654_library_fix.json).",
  "",
  "NAME CANON (wave 3, 2026-07-04):",
  "  sub 28 monster compendium  -> official US names from Busin 1 ELF SLUS_202.59",
  "     (scratchpad audit11/slus_strings.txt): Bubbly Slime, Bogy Cat, Pidepiper,",
  "     Maelific, Raver Lord, Kerberos, Ninetail, Fleshgolem, The High Master, ...",
  "     Busin-0-only monsters use guide/standard renderings (Skedim per",
  "     data/guide_full_text.txt line 6464; Mazikim by analogy).",
  "  sub 41 magic library      -> official US Busin 1 spell names, UNABBREVIATED",
  "     (audit11/spell_names_proposal.json official-US column; consistent with",
  "     tools/patch_r39_inline.py SPELL_NAMES v160 roots).  Entries 44/47 carry",
  "     JP dev alt-names (unagi joke / Un-Depth) for the spells the R39 menu",
  "     calls Vital / Lumil -- translated to the menu-canon names for clarity.",
  "  sub 1 AA name list        -> R1361/R1362 strip canon",
  "     (data/strip_labels/battle_labels.json).  Kanji slots verified by the",
  "     poisoned-glyph cipher (X#XX=focus proven via chunk_09 R2654 msg 8-26 prose)",
  "     and by 1:1 sequence match with the strip sheets.",
  "  sub 43 misc placeholders  -> trivial (None).",
  "",
  "Deliberately left pristine (unresolved poisoned-kanji decode, R47-g52 precedent):",
  "  sub 28 entries 0,97 (blank placeholders) and 112,139,140,148,149,150,151."
 ],
